# Repo core

Follow `.cursor/rules/00-master-system.mdc` for all tasks.

Repo-specific:

- Follow `AGENTS.md` and Next.js docs under `node_modules/next/dist/docs/` before using Next APIs.
- Prefer existing components in `components/`, `app/`, `lib/`, and `design-system/`.
- Do not invent parallel deploy configs when `vercel.json` / `netlify.toml` / `render.yaml` already exist.
